WEBVTT

01:46.377 --> 01:47.962
Wanna try 'em on?

01:48.546 --> 01:50.214
I can't afford it.

01:50.297 --> 01:53.217
Becca gave the nod. All yours, no strings.

01:54.051 --> 01:55.511
No thanks.

01:55.594 --> 01:59.974
Didn't bother you
when you put that klepped Sandy on.

02:00.057 --> 02:03.144
Can't scavenge off someone you knew?

02:03.227 --> 02:05.062
They're techie mitts anyways.

02:05.146 --> 02:07.148
You're just being picky.

02:07.231 --> 02:09.525
I have my sights set on something else.

02:09.608 --> 02:10.901
Wha'tcha got your eyes on?

02:12.403 --> 02:14.405
Oh! This?

02:14.989 --> 02:16.866
Bit big for you, ain't it?

02:16.949 --> 02:18.659
I can handle it.

02:19.243 --> 02:21.745
Sure, all yours if I flatline.

02:22.246 --> 02:25.291
Gives you time to bulk up, grow into 'em.

02:26.083 --> 02:28.669
'Kay. Deal.

02:30.212 --> 02:32.756
Ya know, something's different about you…

02:32.840 --> 02:33.674
Huh?

02:34.258 --> 02:37.803
You're usually moping,
bringing the vibe down…

02:37.887 --> 02:39.430
Resident buzzkill.

02:39.513 --> 02:42.474
I'm not!
And I ain't no different from yesterday!

02:42.558 --> 02:43.934
Nah. Something's off.

02:44.518 --> 02:46.145
Ya get laid?

02:47.813 --> 02:48.731
You did.

02:49.523 --> 02:52.693
Gotta work on that poker face, son!

02:52.776 --> 02:55.446
Kiwi! Any progress?

02:55.529 --> 02:57.781
Not at all.

02:59.283 --> 03:03.203
Tanaka's beefed up his defenses
since the last gig.

03:03.871 --> 03:06.874
Tried poking holes around,
but it's been a no-go.

03:06.957 --> 03:11.211
What did I tell ya? We ain't getting
nowhere unless Faraday feeds us something.

03:11.795 --> 03:13.172
Tanaka?

03:13.255 --> 03:15.966
Remember your very first grand theft auto?

03:16.050 --> 03:17.468
He's the owner of the limo.

03:19.053 --> 03:20.220
Problem?

03:20.304 --> 03:22.014
Nah, it's nothing…

03:22.097 --> 03:23.474
Would you look at that.

03:23.557 --> 03:25.976
You were schoolmates with Tanaka's kid.

03:27.561 --> 03:32.691
What?! You accusing our kid of
going to some stuffy corpo school?!

03:32.775 --> 03:36.737
Bona-fide Arasaka Academy dropout.
Straight A student, too.

03:36.820 --> 03:38.739
I'll be damned!

03:38.822 --> 03:43.827
Guess we now know why Gloria was
always strapped on cash.

03:44.453 --> 03:47.498
What's a guy gotta do
to get some privacy around here?

03:48.290 --> 03:53.212
There's not much else I could find on
Tanaka's private file. The rest is trash.

03:53.295 --> 03:56.006
-Like?
-XBDs in his viewing log.

03:56.090 --> 03:59.551
That's good. We can use it for leverage.

03:59.635 --> 04:01.762
A real kinkster. More gore than porn.

04:01.845 --> 04:04.098
Some cyberpsycho shit, too.

04:04.682 --> 04:07.017
The deep, dark fetishes of a suit.

04:08.143 --> 04:11.021
Lots of vids from a gonk who goes by JK.

04:11.105 --> 04:11.939
JK?

04:13.482 --> 04:14.650
Heard of him?

04:14.733 --> 04:19.405
Sure. Jimmy Kurosaki. The braindance
director with a cult following.

04:19.488 --> 04:24.785
He's known for putting up snuff reels
within 24 hours of it happening.

04:24.868 --> 04:29.164
Never seen any director
do the edits that he does.

04:29.248 --> 04:32.042
No wonder he's got so many fans.

04:32.126 --> 04:35.087
Didn't know you were a superfreak.

04:35.170 --> 04:36.046
Uh, well…

04:36.130 --> 04:39.675
Just helped a choom
move his stock, is all.

04:39.758 --> 04:44.346
That's good and all, but do you have
any intel we can actually use?

04:44.430 --> 04:45.639
They're custom-made.

04:45.723 --> 04:46.557
What?

04:47.141 --> 04:51.103
I heard that he sometimes tunes
custom-made footage for VIPs.

04:51.186 --> 04:53.147
You know, like removing pain limiters?

04:53.230 --> 04:54.565
So what?

04:54.648 --> 04:58.902
If he's tuning the footage,
Tanaka's gotta be there as well.

04:58.986 --> 05:00.195
And probably alone.

05:00.279 --> 05:02.072
Alone? How you figure?

05:02.156 --> 05:05.576
Would you bring a bodyguard
to tune up a fetish BD?

05:07.911 --> 05:08.954
Kid's got a point.

05:09.038 --> 05:11.206
Getting sharp, kid!

05:11.290 --> 05:14.376
Now that you're a man now!

05:14.877 --> 05:17.463
What? Did something happen?

05:17.546 --> 05:18.714
Nothing!

05:19.340 --> 05:22.468
Faraday came through
with a lead on Tanaka.

05:22.551 --> 05:25.846
Seems our favorite suit
occasionally ditches his huscle

05:25.929 --> 05:28.098
and usual ride for a Delamain.

05:28.182 --> 05:30.017
Going off-radar, huh?

05:30.100 --> 05:33.812
But Delamain's got him fully covered.
Still can't pinpoint his destination.

05:33.896 --> 05:37.733
I also looked into
the tuning services for BDs.

05:37.816 --> 05:42.321
The main buyers are fat cats,
corpo execs, celebrities, gang bosses…

05:42.404 --> 05:45.074
You get in by referral
and the location is undisclosed.

05:45.157 --> 05:48.285
If we wanna know more,
we'd have to chat with the man himself.

05:48.368 --> 05:49.661
How?

05:49.745 --> 05:51.371
Gotta grab him in person.

05:51.955 --> 05:57.461
Lucky for us, he has a reservation at
Embers tomorrow. He'll be alone.

05:57.544 --> 05:59.379
At a ritzy place like that? Sad.

05:59.463 --> 06:02.883
Great. When he leaves,
let's invite him here for a nightcap.

06:03.467 --> 06:05.302
Let's go.

06:33.747 --> 06:37.543
Hey! You wouldn't happen to be
Jimmy Kurosaki, would you?

06:39.002 --> 06:39.962
Who's asking?

06:40.045 --> 06:42.464
I knew it! I'm a huge fan, sir!

06:42.548 --> 06:46.927
You know a ripperdoc
in Arroyo who pushes XBDs?

06:47.010 --> 06:50.305
I helped him sell your stuff!

06:50.389 --> 06:51.306
Really.

06:51.390 --> 06:53.684
Can I shake your hand?

06:53.767 --> 06:58.689
Oh, sorry… Guess I'm a bit star-struck.

06:58.772 --> 07:00.566
Yeah, I got places to be.

07:00.649 --> 07:03.068
Right… I won't hold you up.

07:03.152 --> 07:05.028
Was an honor meeting you…

07:14.872 --> 07:16.331
What was that?!

07:20.043 --> 07:21.211
Fuck!

07:22.129 --> 07:23.255
What?!

07:23.839 --> 07:25.757
Maine!

07:26.341 --> 07:27.468
Where's David?

07:27.551 --> 07:29.011
Find him!

07:29.094 --> 07:30.637
Snap out of it!

07:35.851 --> 07:37.186
You alright?

07:37.269 --> 07:40.272
Son of a bitch pulled something on us.

07:41.023 --> 07:42.524
What happened?

07:42.608 --> 07:44.359
They're gone.

07:44.443 --> 07:45.277
Gone?

07:45.903 --> 07:48.030
He nabbed David.

07:49.198 --> 07:51.825
Kiwi! You take Maine and head out.

07:51.909 --> 07:53.035
Okay.

07:53.118 --> 07:54.745
I'm fine…

07:54.828 --> 07:56.788
Be a good boy, and stay!

07:56.872 --> 07:59.041
Lucy! You're with me.

08:07.674 --> 08:11.345
Got him. Mile and change, straight ahead.

08:11.428 --> 08:14.014
What did that asshole use back there?

08:14.097 --> 08:15.933
Seemed like some kind of EMP.

08:16.016 --> 08:20.854
It got Kiwi real bad.
Only gave me a bit of a shock.

08:20.938 --> 08:26.109
Neural implant targeting.
To neutralize runners, clearly.

08:26.693 --> 08:27.653
You seem okay.

08:27.736 --> 08:28.737
I wasn't in range.

08:29.446 --> 08:31.490
David could be in real shit.

08:31.573 --> 08:33.867
It'll be a problem if he uses that again.

08:33.951 --> 08:36.245
Not if we kill him first.

08:37.788 --> 08:39.248
You're pissed, aren't ya?

08:39.831 --> 08:41.291
A little.

09:09.987 --> 09:11.530
Ah, fuck.

09:11.613 --> 09:13.740
Think it's a cyberpsycho?

09:13.824 --> 09:18.370
No shit, let's head out.
Already hailed MaxTac.

09:20.122 --> 09:21.540
Hey, there's another body.

09:22.207 --> 09:25.043
Don't wander off, man.
What if you run into them?

09:25.627 --> 09:28.088
Don't worry. They're not around anymore.

09:29.631 --> 09:31.550
Hm? Who's there?!

09:31.633 --> 09:32.884
The cyberpsycho!

09:32.968 --> 09:34.052
He's got a gun!

09:34.136 --> 09:35.637
-It wasn't me…
-Drop the gun!

09:35.721 --> 09:36.847
Don't move!

09:36.930 --> 09:39.808
-I woke up and I was just…
-Drop it, you fucking psycho!

09:43.645 --> 09:44.938
Who's there?!

09:45.022 --> 09:46.440
Hey! What happened?!

09:53.030 --> 09:54.615
Got a cyberpsycho!

09:54.698 --> 09:55.657
Raise MaxTac now!

10:15.218 --> 10:17.012
Shots fired back there!

10:17.679 --> 10:19.473
Die, bastard!

10:57.052 --> 10:58.220
MaxTac?!

11:20.492 --> 11:21.743
Fucking monster.

11:21.827 --> 11:23.995
No! It wasn't me!

11:39.469 --> 11:41.096
Awesome, isn't it?

11:41.179 --> 11:44.850
Experiencing your own death
instead of someone else's.

11:45.517 --> 11:47.352
Are you fucking kidding me?!

11:47.936 --> 11:51.773
Awesome? You fucking psychopath…

11:52.816 --> 11:55.735
Hey, I thought you were a fan!

11:55.819 --> 11:58.113
Most of my fans are whack jobs.

11:58.697 --> 12:01.366
You're a cyberpunk, aren't you?

12:01.950 --> 12:03.201
What are you after?

12:03.285 --> 12:05.745
Ambushing me in a place like that…

12:06.455 --> 12:10.625
Clearly, you've done your homework.
Have you seen any of my other works?

12:10.709 --> 12:13.253
The Edgerunner series?

12:14.045 --> 12:15.130
Yeah.

12:16.047 --> 12:18.633
I've seen most of your stuff.

12:19.342 --> 12:21.636
Wow. I'm flattered!

12:23.930 --> 12:29.519
Say, have you ever wondered
where I get those cyberpsycho scrolls?

12:29.603 --> 12:30.812
What?

12:30.896 --> 12:36.776
All military prototypes come with
a built-in braindance scroller.

12:37.360 --> 12:42.032
Some people are willing to
pay through the nose for that kinda stuff.

12:45.243 --> 12:48.288
You know who originally owned this Sandy?

12:48.872 --> 12:53.210
James Norris. How many people
did he kill in the end? 27?

12:53.293 --> 12:56.796
Had a hell of a run-in
with MaxTac in the end.

12:57.464 --> 13:02.928
It's not often you get a guy
who can go toe-to-toe with them.

13:03.011 --> 13:07.641
That was so good…
One of the best I've seen in a while.

13:10.268 --> 13:13.647
I've got high expectations for you, too.

13:13.730 --> 13:17.776
I'm surprised you're still sane
after wearing this.

13:17.859 --> 13:21.404
The side-effects are gonna
drive you mad, eventually.

13:21.488 --> 13:23.865
Can't wait to see it.

13:23.949 --> 13:26.409
I'm not gonna go psycho!

13:26.493 --> 13:30.664
That's what all chromers say.

13:30.747 --> 13:33.917
They think they're all sane
until they aren't.

13:34.000 --> 13:34.918
Not me!

13:35.001 --> 13:36.419
Yes, you.

13:37.003 --> 13:42.175
Another couple rounds with the MaxTac
and your brain'll burst like a balloon.

13:43.760 --> 13:47.764
Wait. You're not gonna
make me go through that again…

13:49.015 --> 13:50.809
Hey, stop!

13:50.892 --> 13:51.935
Cut it out!

13:52.018 --> 13:53.937
Stop!

13:58.608 --> 13:59.484
Don't move!

14:04.072 --> 14:05.490
Put your hands up…

14:06.074 --> 14:07.242
Or you're dead.

14:07.951 --> 14:09.494
You got me!

14:14.416 --> 14:15.250
How's David?

14:15.333 --> 14:17.043
He's in a BD or something.

14:17.127 --> 14:19.004
-Can you get him out?
-I'll try.

14:19.588 --> 14:20.672
Need a hand?

14:20.755 --> 14:21.756
Shut it!

14:21.840 --> 14:23.091
Got it!

14:27.012 --> 14:29.472
David! You alright?

14:29.556 --> 14:31.558
Aw, what a shame.

14:32.392 --> 14:35.020
So? What do you guys want?

14:35.103 --> 14:37.647
I assume you're not here to kill me.

14:37.731 --> 14:39.399
That's still up for jury.

14:39.482 --> 14:42.152
Come on. I'll cooperate.

14:42.235 --> 14:43.778
You catch on quick.

14:50.243 --> 14:52.037
That better not be…

14:53.997 --> 14:55.665
Armed drones!

14:55.749 --> 14:56.666
Bingo!

14:57.417 --> 14:58.460
Call them off!

14:58.543 --> 15:00.253
No can do.

15:00.337 --> 15:04.674
Go on, give 'em a wave.
They're my best toys. Bulletproof and all.

15:04.758 --> 15:08.428
Good luck putting them down
with those tiny little bangers.

15:08.511 --> 15:10.472
I'll blow your brains out first!

15:10.555 --> 15:12.307
Well, that wouldn't be very smart.

15:12.390 --> 15:16.561
That won't stop them from turning you
into a bloodstain on my floor.

15:16.645 --> 15:20.690
Yeah? They won't shoot as long as
I'm using you as a meat-shield.

15:24.069 --> 15:26.529
Knew it was smart to have two.

15:26.613 --> 15:27.572
Shit!

15:28.156 --> 15:30.241
Oh no! Looks like you're surrounded.

15:30.325 --> 15:31.868
Ready to give up?

15:31.952 --> 15:33.161
Shut up!

15:33.244 --> 15:34.079
Lucy!

15:34.162 --> 15:35.830
On it…

15:38.583 --> 15:39.709
I need more time…

15:45.799 --> 15:46.633
David!

15:46.716 --> 15:48.218
I'll distract them!

15:54.182 --> 15:55.350
Hurry it up, Lucy!

16:23.378 --> 16:25.213
Wow! That was impressive!

16:25.296 --> 16:26.923
-Mother…
-Fucker!

16:27.674 --> 16:31.052
White flag! White flag!
Okay, I surrender for real this time!

16:31.136 --> 16:32.846
White flag my ass!

16:32.929 --> 16:35.432
You're already dead, shit stain!

16:35.515 --> 16:38.435
I mean, alright, but I thought
you wanted to ask me things?

16:38.518 --> 16:39.686
God dammit!

16:39.769 --> 16:45.358
Hey girl! Takes real talent
to pull off a hack so quickly.

16:46.526 --> 16:49.946
I'll listen to what you have to say,
but can I get up, please?

16:50.030 --> 16:52.782
No funny business or I'll kill you myself.

16:52.866 --> 16:54.909
I won't. Pinky swear.

16:56.244 --> 16:59.205
Alright. Everyone got the plan?

16:59.289 --> 17:01.624
Aye aye, captain.

17:01.708 --> 17:04.711
I'll call you later.
Until then, stay here.

17:05.378 --> 17:08.506
Keep an eye on him.
Don't let him out of your sight.

17:16.306 --> 17:18.224
Sorry about earlier.

17:18.850 --> 17:19.726
Whatever.

17:20.393 --> 17:23.063
Didn't think you'd agree
to help us so easily.

17:23.563 --> 17:29.444
I know how cyberpunks work.
I don't really have a choice, do I?

17:30.028 --> 17:30.987
Well, yeah.

17:32.238 --> 17:34.074
You've seen that one too?

17:34.157 --> 17:34.991
Yeah.

17:35.075 --> 17:37.952
You saw it
and you still installed the Sandy?

17:38.036 --> 17:39.746
You're one crazy dude.

17:39.829 --> 17:42.499
I won't end up like him.

17:42.582 --> 17:46.377
James Norris was a soldier
who knew his way around implants.

17:46.461 --> 17:49.089
But even he couldn't take it
and went psycho.

17:49.672 --> 17:52.467
What makes you think you're different?

17:53.218 --> 17:56.721
I don't know. It just… feels right.

17:57.263 --> 17:59.849
It's like the implant's
always been a part of me.

18:00.683 --> 18:03.978
I think… I'm built different.

18:04.562 --> 18:06.815
You think you're special?

18:06.898 --> 18:07.732
Sure.

18:10.819 --> 18:14.447
I've seen plenty of chromejocks
go psycho over the years.

18:14.531 --> 18:17.659
Some metal's simply not meant to
mix with meat.

18:17.742 --> 18:23.748
Your organic body, your soul, gets pushed
to the edge. Teeters on the brink.

18:24.332 --> 18:26.751
It always comes down to one of two things.

18:26.835 --> 18:29.254
You either lose your mind…

18:29.838 --> 18:32.006
Or die… No in-between.

18:40.098 --> 18:43.268
We will be arriving
at the destination shortly.

18:44.978 --> 18:48.731
As requested, the record of
your ride today has been expunged.

18:48.815 --> 18:50.984
I look forward to serving you again.

18:53.236 --> 18:57.490
Hey, Mister Tanaka. Come on in.

18:59.284 --> 19:01.452
You're early.

19:01.536 --> 19:04.289
It usually takes months for a new release.

19:04.372 --> 19:08.793
Well, it's difficult finding
good material, you see.

19:08.877 --> 19:12.255
But this next one'll be worth your while.

19:12.338 --> 19:15.300
Would you like to have it
tuned immediately?

19:15.383 --> 19:18.303
My son is being discharged
from the hospital tonight.

19:18.386 --> 19:20.763
I will just be taking the chip.

19:21.556 --> 19:23.057
I see.

19:23.725 --> 19:26.686
That's unfortunate. I'm proud of
how this one turned out.

19:26.769 --> 19:29.814
It'd be a huge waste not to have it tuned.

19:29.898 --> 19:32.066
The sensitivity'd be off the charts.

19:32.150 --> 19:33.568
Mister Kurosaki.

19:33.651 --> 19:35.528
I do not humor slow men.

19:35.612 --> 19:37.322
Unfortunate's one word for it.

19:37.947 --> 19:42.827
Would've made our job a lot easier
if you were in that BD.

19:43.411 --> 19:44.412
Who are you?

19:44.495 --> 19:45.872
Don't try nothing.

19:47.540 --> 19:49.083
The nerve…

19:49.167 --> 19:52.337
Super sorry, sir.
They have me by the balls.

19:52.420 --> 19:55.548
Do you have any idea
who you're dealing with?

19:58.426 --> 20:02.096
Forget about the panic button.
We've got a jammer up.

20:05.058 --> 20:06.851
Just as planned, I see.

20:15.568 --> 20:16.694
Not fucking now!

20:25.995 --> 20:26.955
Maine!

20:30.458 --> 20:31.376
You're…

20:37.674 --> 20:39.842
Pain in my ass.

20:46.724 --> 20:48.101
Must've been the needles.

20:48.184 --> 20:49.352
Got him in the neck.

20:49.435 --> 20:50.895
Shit, he really was slow.

20:50.979 --> 20:52.897
He's suffocating.

20:52.981 --> 20:54.649
Ah… Sucks for him.

20:54.732 --> 20:58.903
Looks like he won't be around
to edit his own death scroll.

21:08.079 --> 21:09.163
Flatlined.

21:10.248 --> 21:12.417
Shit. Trauma Team's coming.

21:12.500 --> 21:15.044
What? This bitch had Trauma coverage?

21:15.128 --> 21:17.797
Yup. Platinum and everything.

21:17.880 --> 21:18.923
Fuck.

21:20.842 --> 21:22.677
Kid, we're getting the hell out!

21:22.760 --> 21:25.430
Now. They find us and we're fucked.
